<a href="#"><img alt="P1" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9" align="top"></a> **Profile Gateway key loses**

If the deployment sets `HERMES_WEBUI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` and a named profile sets its own Gateway URL and `API_SERVER_KEY`, this merge keeps both keys. `_gateway_api_key()` then picks the inherited `HERMES_WEBUI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`, not the profile's explicit key. The profile's chats send the wrong key and can fail authentication.

