--- 4279625215 greptile-apps[bot] 2026-10-15T06:02:59Z api/profiles.py aac413d65b in_reply_to None
<a href="#"><img alt="P1" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9" align="top"></a> **Other profiles change Gateway**

`_reload_dotenv()` now replaces the shared Gateway defaults after every reload, including onboarding for a named profile. Onboarding reads the request's profile home, not necessarily the process profile. If that profile defines its own Gateway URL and key, saving its provider setup makes those values the defaults for every named profile that omits them. Their later chats use the wrong Gateway and account.

Refresh shared deployment defaults only for the process-owned profile. Keep request-profile reloads separate.

