These new tests call `_reload_dotenv()` and onboarding functions that write directly to `os.environ`, but never restore those values. Patching module globals does not undo those writes. This test leaves `HERMES_WEBUI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=launcher-key`; the onboarding cases also leave Gateway settings and `LM_API_KEY`.

Save and restore the affected environment values around these tests. Otherwise, later tests inherit fake settings and their results can depend on test order.

