3. **[SILENT/should-fix] `max` is downgraded to `xhigh` on the current Agent** (`api/gateway_chat.py:568`, `api/runner_client.py:98`). The installed receiver accepts `max` but doesn't advertise `reasoning_efforts`, so both lanes send `xhigh`. `features.reasoning_streaming` was ad
